      "updated": 1784972037
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba288",
      "text": "[リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：実装ページ]を軽量化する案",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784974134
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba289",
      "text": "未完成品[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a648b58000000000064d9a1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784974169,
      "updated": 1784974169
    },
    {
      "id": "6a648bc5000000000064d9ac",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784974278,
      "updated": 1784974278
    },
    {
      "id": "6a648bc5000000000064d9ad",
      "text": "　[別名リンク記法]（[/customize/別名リンク記法]）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784974278,
      "updated": 1784974324
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482ec00000000009ba2ad",
      "text": " リンクテキスト未指定時の動作を[リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS]に準じた状態にする",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784972013,
      "updated": 1784974176
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64833100000000009ba2af",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784972082,
      "updated": 1784972082
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba28f",
      "text": " code:style.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba290",
      "text": "  .line:not(.cursor-line) .deco-\\. {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba291",
      "text": "  \tdisplay: inline-block;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784972284
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6483ef00000000009ba2b0",
      "text": "  \tposition: relative; z-index: 0;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784972272,
      "updated": 1784973434
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64887e0000000000694f64",
      "text": "  \ttop: -0.5em;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784973438,
      "updated": 1784973438
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64887a0000000000694f62",
      "text": "  \tmargin-left: 1px;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784973434,
      "updated": 1784973480
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6487d00000000000694f53",
      "text": "  \tmin-width: 1.15em;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784973265,
      "updated": 1784973284
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba293",
      "text": "  \tline-height: 1.0;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba294",
      "text": "  \tfont-size: .8em;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784973407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba297",
      "text": "  ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba298",
      "text": "  \tcolor: var(--page-link-color);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba299",
      "text": "  \t&:hover, &:active { color: var(--page-link-hover-color); }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba29a",
      "text": "  \t&:has(> span:not(.char-index):nth-of-type(1) > a.page-link.empty-page-link) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba29b",
      "text": "  \t\t--page-link-color: var(--empty-page-link-color);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba29c",
      "text": "  \t\t&:hover, &:active { --page-link-hover-color: var(--empty-page-link-hover-color); }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba29d",
      "text": "  \t}",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64856100000000009ba2c0",
      "text": "  \t",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784972641,
      "updated": 1784972641
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64855900000000009ba2b9",
      "text": " \t\t&::before {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784972633,
      "updated": 1784972637
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64855900000000009ba2ba",
      "text": " \t\t\tcontent: \"\\f02d\"; font-weight: 900;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784972633,
      "updated": 1784972637
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64855900000000009ba2bb",
      "text": " \t\t\tfont-family: var(--icons, \"Font Awesome 5 Brand\", \"Font Awesome 5 Free\", AppIcons);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784972633,
      "updated": 1784972637
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6489250000000000694f65",
      "text": "      vertical-align: middle;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784973606,
      "updated": 1784973608
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64855900000000009ba2bc",
      "text": " \t\t}",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784972633,
      "updated": 1784972637
    },
    {
      "id": "6a64881a0000000000694f5f",
      "text": " \t\t",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784974449,
      "updated": 1784974449
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6488130000000000694f55",
      "text": "    /* 斜体を取り消す */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784974449,
      "updated": 1784974449
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6488130000000000694f56",
      "text": "    &.deco-\\/ {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784974449,
      "updated": 1784974449
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6488130000000000694f57",
      "text": "      font-style: normal;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784974449,
      "updated": 1784974449
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6488130000000000694f58",
      "text": "    }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784974449,
      "updated": 1784974449
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6488130000000000694f59",
      "text": "    &.deco-\\/::before {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784973332,
      "updated": 1784974374
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6488130000000000694f5b",
      "text": "      content: \"\\f15c\"; font-weight: 400;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784973332,
      "updated": 1784974402
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6488130000000000694f5d",
      "text": "    }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784973332,
      "updated": 1784973344
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6488170000000000694f5e",
      "text": "    ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784973335,
      "updated": 1784973336
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba29f",
      "text": "  \t& > span:not(.char-index):nth-of-type(1) > a:is(.page-link:not(.icon), .link) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784974649
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba2a0",
      "text": "  \t\tdisplay: inline-block; position: absolute; overflow: hidden; text-wrap: nowrap; z-index: 10;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784973544
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba2a1",
      "text": "  \t\tmax-width: 100%;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba2a2",
      "text": "  \t\t--page-link-color: transparent;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba2a3",
      "text": "  \t\t--page-link-hover-color: transparent;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba2a4",
      "text": "  \t\t--empty-page-link-color: transparent;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba2a5",
      "text": "  \t\t--empty-page-link-hover-color: transparent;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba2a6",
      "text": "  \t}",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784972631
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba2aa",
      "text": "  }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6482d300000000009ba2ab",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784971988,
      "updated": 1784971988
